{{Quote|text=Sometimes I reminisce about my engineering curriculum at Pellcar University. Life was so simple back then. No one told me 'adulting' would be like this. You're off on your own with no one to guide you.}}
'''Victor''' lives with his mother, [[Olivia]]. They both moved to Pelican Town after Olivia retired from working for JojaCo. Victor recently graduated at the top of his class from a prestigious university with a Bachelor's in Engineering. He isn’t sure what he wants to do with his life, but he wants to find the role that makes him happy, not rich. 

He spends most of his days in the museum or the park, gazing out at the ocean, playing arcade games, and reading books.

Living at home with his mother sometimes strains Victor. They are too alike in some ways and clash when their moods are negative. Olivia wants the best for Victor, but doesn't understand that what he wants and what she thinks is best are not always the same. While they don't have much in common, Victor admires her ability to pick up new hobbies and thrive in new phases of her life.

Victor is close friends with Sam, Sebastian, and Abigail, who all share a love of video games and computers. On Fridays, he joins the three in the Saloon by the pool table. He is also friends with Sophia, whom he met through Olivia's purchases of Blue Moon Wine.

