==Quotes==
<!---Keep to a list of 5 quotes for general section and 2-3 for events--->
Here is a selection of {{PAGENAME}}'s dialogue lines.
<div class="mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" data-expandtext="❇ Show ❇" data-collapsetext="✖ Hide ✖">* General <div class=mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder></div>
<div class="mw-collapsible-content">
{{QuotesTableStart|label = Regular}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= Spring 15|quote= "There are eight bridges in Stardew Valley. Over half of those are in Pelican Town. There are also many small wooden makeshift bridges everywhere, such as the one at the beach. It's incredible that bridges can allow different communities to connect with one another."}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= Summer 15|quote= "My mother was a senior accounting manager at Joja's International Shipping Branch. She received a lot of money and bonuses at her job, then made even more when she cashed out her stock. She does daily stock trading now. I can't see myself trading. Stock trading sounds a bit unfulfilling in my opinion, but we each have our destiny."}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= Summer Fridays, 4 Hearts|quote= "I guess I get my moodiness from my mother. Sometimes, we end up just spending our evenings sulking in silence together. I hope you don't take it personally when I'm short with you, [Player]. You know I enjoy your company when my own mood isn't getting in the way."}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= Sundays, 8 Hearts|quote= "Video games are amazing in their own unique way, same with books. Nothing else really pulls you into a completely different world. It's healthy to take a break from reality, wouldn't you say?"}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= Winter Thursdays, 8 Hearts|quote= "I designed a prototype trestle bridge for fun today in a simulation program I created. These types of bridges are useful if you need to cross over marshes or shallows. Trestle bridges are cheaper to build than other types of bridges because they use wooden supports instead of stone or steel. It does sound a bit like a video game, doesn't it? You'd be surprised how many skills you learn in games come in handy elsewhere."}}
{{TableEnd}}</div></div>

<div class="mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" data-expandtext="❇ Show ❇" data-collapsetext="✖ Hide ✖">* Events <div class=mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder></div>
<div class="mw-collapsible-content">
{{QuotesTableStart|label = Events}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= [[Stardew:Luau|Luau]], even years|quote= "The soup at the luau is always good, but all soup is better with noodles. I could throw my own in? Hm..."}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= [[Stardew:Fair|Stardew Valley Fair]], odd years|quote= "These moonlight jellies travel here all the way from across the world. They were at the Fern Islands just a few months ago."}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= [[Stardew:Spirit's Eve|Spirit's Eve]], 3rd year, then every 4 years|quote= "These monsters are quite fascinating. Perhaps I'll try to converse with the Castle Village adventurers tonight... They're bound to have some cool adventuring stories."}}
{{TableEnd}}</div></div>

